{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you shall keep My statutes and do them.</b> In this manner — that you sanctify yourselves by separation from the forbidden sexual unions — you shall keep and do for the generations, for if you do not sanctify yourselves, your children will surely rebel as well, being born in sin, as it says: הֵן בְּעָווֹן חוֹלָלְתִּי (Psalms 51:7)." "<b>I am YHWH who sanctifies you.</b> For indeed what I have forbidden in the forbidden sexual unions is in order to sanctify you for My service."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:04.369669265Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}